OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, who died in sea named at
OL,4,Ainquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has heard that a 15-year-old
OL,7,Ffrom Bradford died after getting into
OL,8,Fdifficulty in the sea in Pembrokeshire.
OL,10,FMarcin Michal Komoszewski died after
OL,11,Fentering the water at Marloes Sands
OL,12,Fbeach on 30 August while on holiday
OL,13,Fwith his family. Two other people who
OL,14,Fwere also experiencing difficulties
OL,15,Fmanaged to get out of the water.
OL,17,FRescue attempts were made by his family
OL,18,Fand a member of the public but "contact
OL,19,Fwith him was eventually lost" and the
OL,20,Fsearch was called off after two days.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
