OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, who died in sea named at
OL,4,Ainquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarcin's body was eventually spotted by
OL,7,Fa passing yacht near St Anne's Head on
OL,8,F8 September and later recovered by
OL,9,FAngle RNLI.
